X10A01 ~y~Karim:~w~ Siahdast is down! Sweep the fortress, nobody gets behind us.
X10A02 ~y~Karim:~w~ The fortress is quiet. Check the dead before we move.
X10A03 ~y~Karim:~w~ Man down! Keep your head low!
X10A04 ~r~Guard:~w~ Intruders! Sound the alarm, to the walls!
X10A05 ~r~Guard:~w~ More men from the barracks! Flank them!
